dcc-proxy (0.1.7) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Display subscription policy groups as collapsible native node grids.
  * Show routing chains from the matched policy to the actual outbound node.
  * Add website rules with automatic domain/IP parsing and current policy.
  * Validate override conflicts and preserve the previous profile on failure.
  * Align the bundled official Mihomo core with Clash Party v1.19.16.
  * Refresh mismatched core caches safely and build with 12 jobs by default.

