dcc-proxy (0.1.5) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Support Array.includes in JavaScript overrides on the system Qt 5.11 engine.
  * Report script exceptions with their actual cause and source line.
  * Pass the subscription name to main(config, profileName).
  * Preserve plain JSON objects and validate synchronous configuration results.
  * Add mixed, HTTP, SOCKS, redirection and TProxy port controls with rollback.
  * Synchronize owned manual/PAC proxies and reject TCP/UDP listener conflicts.
  * Use neutral subscription/resource User-Agent defaults.
  * Bound and scroll long messages without compressing the page controls.
  * Explain advanced configuration editors and provide validated YAML examples.
  * Show recent backend logs and report/reconnect live log streams.
  * Add the native password visibility toggle for the API secret.
  * Expand page actions, HTTPS backup and real-core log regression coverage.

 -- DCC Proxy maintainers <Mars-cb@users.noreply.github.com>  Fri, 16 Oct 2026 15:00:00 +0800

dcc-proxy (0.1.4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Show imported subscription nodes without a running core or system proxy.
  * Bundle verified official GeoIP MMDB, GeoIP.dat, GeoSite.dat and ASN data.
  * Seed private kernel data from the deb without first-run downloads.
  * Preserve usable user databases and back up interrupted downloads.
  * Provide a default mixed listener when full YAML subscriptions omit one.
  * Wait for the mixed listener even when automatic system proxy is disabled.
  * Keep base geodata automatic updates disabled unless explicitly overridden.

